1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,429
[Narrator] Imagine standing on the eastern coast of North America nearly 400 years ago.

2
00:00:05,429 --> 00:00:08,379
[Narrator] There are no skyscrapers, no highways,

3
00:00:08,429 --> 00:00:11,900
[Narrator] no massive cities stretching across the horizon.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,669
[Narrator] And there is no United States of America.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:20,460
[Narrator] Instead, there are vast forests, winding rivers, mountains, coastal villages,

6
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,859
[Narrator] farms, trading communities,

7
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:28,660
[Narrator] and hundreds of indigenous nations whose histories on this continent reach back

8
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:32,549
[Narrator] thousands  of years.
Along the Atlantic coast, however,

9
00:00:32,549 --> 00:00:34,640
[Narrator] something is beginning to change.

